Author: Qiyuan Xu <xqyww123@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Sep 14 20:27:44 2026 +0800

    Guard cache: the provenance audit's rulings applied (plan rev 26, section 37)
    
    guard_decision and guess_inst records are written under the runtime
    ML_debugger option; their own switches \<phi>log_guard_decision and
    \<phi>log_guess_inst are deleted.  The loud guard warning fires only when
    the judge overturns a Proved entry and reads "A guard condition proved
    before is now refuted by the LLM judge:"; a refuter's verdict over a Proved
    entry is silent and an Unknown ending gets the undecided-guard warning.
    The replay's goal is Goal.init's, concluded at the call site.  The entry
    decoder catches Subscript and Unpack only.  The plan's judge contract is
    corrected: a lemma's proof may cite the contextual assumptions by name --
    a replay rebuilds the same context; the drafter's "may re-enter PLPR"
    reversal of the 2026-09-07 rule is withdrawn; other provenance errors
    fixed.  Test/Guard_Decision_Smoke.thy: declare [[ML_debugger]], the three
    probes whose ending changed, warnings_of/assert_loud on the loud warning.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

