Author: Qiyuan Xu <xqyww123@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Sep 14 20:30:09 2026 +0800

    Event_Log: the record boundary is the comment line "<!-- record -->"
    
    Every item (a record or a human comment) is preceded by the marker; the
    reader splits the file at it and parses each piece on its own.  The
    space-stuffing transform of the writer and its inverse in both readers are
    gone -- the marker cannot occur inside an item ("<" is escaped in text and
    attribute values; a comment body never contains "--").  Plan section 5/8
    record the ruling.  ai-artifacts/event_log_migrate.py migrated the
    existing logs (591 files, 303609 records before and after);
    ai-artifacts/Event_Log_Marker_Probe.thy is a TEMPORARY check of the
    edited source until Test/Event_Log_Test.thy runs on a rebuilt heap.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

